{"key": "payment", "url": "https://wxgaochu.com/payment.html?sku=ai_super_individual_annual", "title": "活动与会员报名｜创作工作台", "html": "<html lang=\"zh-CN\" data-immersive-translate-page-theme=\"light\"><plasmo-csui></plasmo-csui><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\">\n  <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\">\n  <!-- 注意：不要在这里写 frame-ancestors —— 规范明确 meta 形式下该指令会被忽略，\n       浏览器每次都会丢一条控制台错误；防嵌框由 Caddy 的响应头\n       （@payment_pages: frame-ancestors 'none' + X-Frame-Options DENY）负责。 -->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'\">\n  <title>活动与会员报名｜创作工作台</title>\n  <!-- wxgc-share-meta:start -->\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"稳步向前，抵达更高处。\">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"活动与会员报名｜创作工作台\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"稳步向前，抵达更高处。\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.wxgaochu.com/assets/img/wxgc-ico.png\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:title\" content=\"活动与会员报名｜创作工作台\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:description\" content=\"稳步向前，抵达更高处。\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:image\" content=\"https://www.wxgaochu.com/assets/img/wxgc-ico.png\">\n  <!-- wxgc-share-meta:end -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/payment.css?v=coupon-fields-20261111-full\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/wxgc-member/visit-counter.css?v=coupon-fields-20261111-full\">\n  \n  <!-- wxgc-wechat-share:start -->\n  \n  <!-- wxgc-wechat-share:end -->\n  \n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page-glow glow-one\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"page-glow glow-two\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/creator-workbench/assets/img/wxgc-ico.png\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>创作工作台</strong><small>STEADY · HIGHER</small></span></a>\n    <a class=\"member-link\" href=\"/login.html\">会员登录 <span>→</span></a>\n  </header>\n  <main class=\"page-shell\">\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">SELECT · CONFIRM · PAY</span><h1>选择这一次，<br><em>向高处走的方式。</em></h1></div>\n      <p>活动单次报名不会自动开通会员；会员商品支付后，由运营官按照订单逐笔开通或延长会期。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"payment-layout\">\n      <div class=\"catalog-column\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\"><span>01</span><div><h2>选择商品</h2><p>价格与规格来自创作工作台官方商品目录</p></div></div>\n        <div id=\"catalog-status\" class=\"loading-card\" hidden=\"\"><i></i><span>正在读取商品目录…</span></div>\n        <div id=\"catalog-notice\" class=\"catalog-notice\" hidden=\"\"></div>\n        <div id=\"product-list\" class=\"product-list\"><article class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-head\"><div><small>PRODUCT 01</small><h3>AI超级个体联盟实战会员</h3><p>AI 实战训练与会员内容权益</p></div><span class=\"product-category\">会员</span></div><div class=\"sku-list\"><label class=\"sku-option selected\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"sku\" value=\"ai_super_individual_annual\"><strong>年度会员版</strong><b class=\"sku-price\"><s>¥3986</s>¥1286</b><span>支付成功后请运营官开通：有效期365天</span><em>会员服务</em></label></div></article></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <aside id=\"checkout-card\" class=\"checkout-card\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <div class=\"checkout-top\"><div class=\"checkout-top-left\"><span class=\"step-no\">02</span><span class=\"checkout-label\">支付确认</span></div><div class=\"checkout-top-right\"><i>微信支付</i><button id=\"checkout-toggle\" class=\"checkout-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">收起</button></div></div>\n        <section id=\"checkout-select\">\n          <div id=\"selected-summary\" class=\"selected-summary\"><small>已选规格</small><h2 id=\"selected-name\">AI超级个体联盟实战会员 · 年度会员版</h2><div><strong id=\"selected-price\"><s>¥3986</s>¥1286</strong><span id=\"selected-meta\">365天 · 人工开通/延长</span></div></div>\n          <div id=\"checkout-form-wrapper\" class=\"checkout-form-wrapper\">\n            <form id=\"buyer-form\" novalidate=\"\">\n              <label for=\"buyer-name\">购买人姓名</label>\n              <input id=\"buyer-name\" name=\"buyerName\" autocomplete=\"name\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"用于运营官核对订单\" required=\"\" readonly=\"\">\n              <label for=\"buyer-phone\">手机号码</label>\n              <input id=\"buyer-phone\" name=\"buyerPhone\" type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"tel\" maxlength=\"20\" placeholder=\"用于接收活动或会员通知\" required=\"\" readonly=\"\">\n              <p id=\"member-order-note\" class=\"member-order-note\">已登录会员：订单将自动关联当前会员手机号。</p>\n              <div id=\"coupon-box\" class=\"coupon-box\">\n                <label for=\"coupon-input\">优惠码（可选）</label>\n                <div class=\"coupon-row\">\n                  <input id=\"coupon-input\" name=\"couponCode\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"输入优惠码立减\">\n                  <button id=\"coupon-apply\" class=\"coupon-apply\" type=\"button\">使用</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"coupon-msg\" class=\"coupon-msg\" role=\"alert\" data-type=\"\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"checkout-message\" class=\"checkout-message\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n              <button id=\"pay-button\" class=\"pay-button\" type=\"submit\"><span>确认并生成支付码</span><b>→</b></button>\n            </form>\n            <div class=\"checkout-notes\"><span>✓ 服务端核对真实价格</span><span>✓ 支付结果由微信签名确认</span><span>✓ 不保存银行卡信息</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"checkout-qr\" class=\"qr-stage\" hidden=\"\">\n          <div class=\"qr-kicker\">微信扫码支付</div>\n          <div id=\"qr-mobile-notice\" class=\"qr-mobile-notice\" hidden=\"\"></div>\n          <div id=\"qr-frame\" class=\"qr-frame\"><img id=\"payment-qr\" alt=\"微信支付二维码\"><div id=\"qr-loading\">正在生成支付码…</div></div>\n          <strong id=\"qr-price\">¥—</strong><p id=\"qr-product\">—</p>\n          <div class=\"order-meta\"><span>订单号 <b id=\"qr-order\">—</b></span><span>支付码剩余 <b id=\"qr-countdown\">—</b></span></div>\n          <p class=\"polling\"><i></i> 正在安全确认支付结果，请勿关闭页面 <button type=\"button\" id=\"back-to-form\" class=\"back-to-form-btn\">返回修改</button></p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"checkout-result\" class=\"result-stage\" hidden=\"\">\n          <div id=\"result-icon\" class=\"result-icon\">✓</div><span id=\"result-kicker\">PAYMENT CONFIRMED</span>\n          <h2 id=\"result-title\">支付成功</h2><p id=\"result-copy\">我们已经收到您的订单。</p>\n          <div id=\"repurchase-notice\" class=\"repurchase-notice\" hidden=\"\"><b>复购提醒</b><span>您已复购，请联系运营官帮忙延长会期。</span></div>\n          <dl><div><dt>订单号</dt><dd id=\"result-order\">—</dd></div><div><dt>购买手机号</dt><dd id=\"result-phone\">—</dd></div></dl>\n          <section id=\"membership-next-steps\" class=\"membership-next-steps\" aria-labelledby=\"membership-next-title\" hidden=\"\">\n            <h3 id=\"membership-next-title\">接下来，按这 5 步开启会员权益</h3>\n            <p class=\"membership-next-intro\">先补录信息，运营官会协助你完成后续开通。</p>\n            <ol class=\"membership-steps\">\n              <li class=\"membership-step-current\">\n                <span class=\"membership-step-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\n                <a class=\"membership-step-link\" href=\"https://www.wxgaochu.com/member-apply.html\">\n                  <span><strong>补录会员信息</strong><small>现在就做 · 点击填写，方便运营官核对订单</small></span>\n                  <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li><span class=\"membership-step-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><div class=\"membership-step-copy\"><strong>运营官提供激活码</strong><small>信息核对后，请留意运营官的微信消息。</small></div></li>\n              <li><span class=\"membership-step-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><div class=\"membership-step-copy\"><strong>激活登录会员系统</strong><small>收到激活码后，按指引激活并登录。</small></div></li>\n              <li><span class=\"membership-step-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><div class=\"membership-step-copy\"><strong>享受会员各项权益</strong><small>进入会员系统，查看并使用你的专属权益。</small></div></li>\n              <li><span class=\"membership-step-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><div class=\"membership-step-copy\"><strong>每周一入会员群</strong><small>运营官每周一统一安排入群，请留意邀请。</small></div></li>\n            </ol>\n          </section>\n          <button id=\"new-order\" class=\"pay-button secondary\" type=\"button\"><span>继续查看商品</span><b>→</b></button>\n        </section>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <footer><span>创作工作台 · 今天，向高处，再稳行一步。</span><span class=\"visit-counter visit-counter--inline\" data-vercount-counter=\"compact\" aria-label=\"网站访问数据\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-vercount-state=\"unavailable\" hidden=\"\"><span>本页浏览 <strong data-vercount-page-pv=\"\">—</strong> 次</span><span class=\"visit-counter__separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>全站访问 <strong data-vercount-site-pv=\"\">—</strong> 次</span></span><a href=\"/\">返回官网</a></footer>\n  \n\n\n<a id=\"bottomBar\" style=\"position: fixed; bottom: -40px; left: 0px; z-index: 9999; transform: translateX(-50%); background-color: transparent; border-radius: 5px 5px 0px 0px; opacity: 0.3; padding: 5px; transition: 0.3s; cursor: pointer; max-height: 100px; max-width: 45px;\"><img src=\"chrome-extension://kobncfkmjelbefaoohoblamnbackjggk/icon/icon_32.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"></a></body><plasmo-csui id=\"aitdk-csui\"></plasmo-csui><div id=\"immersive-translate-popup\" style=\"all: initial\"></div></html>", "controls": [{"tag": "INPUT", "id": "", "name": "sku", "type": "radio", "text": "", "value": "ai_super_individual_annual", "disabled": false, "attributes": []}, {"tag": "INPUT", "id": "buyer-name", "name": "buyerName", "type": "text", "text": "用于运营官核对订单", "value": "演示用户", "disabled": false, "attributes": [